# [NMOP](../wg/nmop.html)

## Summary

The Network Management Operations (NMOP) Working Group met at IETF 127. The session covered working group document status updates, an operational presentation on deploying an AI agent in the IETF NOC network, a detailed discussion on the proposed NMOP working group rechartering, and two proposals for AI-related operational experiments.

